  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Replay a Muse EEG CSV recording (or connect to a live LSL stream) as a live 4-channel trace. A threshold engine labels each 4-second window Concentrating, Neutral or Relaxed with a confidence score, and the dashboard shows signal quality, connection status and statistics. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
